e is used.')}</p>`:c.ticker==='SNPS'?`<p class="micro" id="snps-claims-help">${annualTextHTML(SNPS_CLAIM_NOTE)}</p>`:c.ticker==='CDNS'?`<p class="micro" id="cdns-claims-help">${annualTextHTML(CDNS_CLAIM_NOTE)}</p>`:c.ticker==='FN'?`<p class="micro">${annualTextHTML('Edits update only this FN draft. Blank claims stay unknown. Awards and warrants are allocated jointly from intrinsic value; no market-price input or second exercise-proceeds credit is added.')}</p>`:'<p class="micro" data-i18n="annual.copy.80256f8ddadb">Edits update only this annual research draft. Clearing a claim amount leaves it unknown. Gross-share stresses are not option valuations. AAOI and NBIS require date-consistent funding/ownership bridges before common-equity output.</p>'}${currentLoad}</details>`;
